WEBVTT

00:04.840 --> 00:10.470
I have always believed

00:10.600 --> 00:14.980
終わらない夢を握りしめて

00:10.600 --> 00:14.980
owaranai yume wo nigirishimete

00:10.600 --> 00:14.980
in taking hold of that endless dream.

00:14.980 --> 00:18.270
TRUST ME MY WAY

00:27.990 --> 00:31.910
DON'T MIND 時にこの想い

00:27.990 --> 00:31.910
DON'T MIND toki ni kono omoi

00:27.990 --> 00:31.910
I don't mind... sometimes feeling like

00:31.910 --> 00:34.620
空回りするけど

00:31.910 --> 00:34.620
karamawari suru kedo

00:31.910 --> 00:34.620
I'm just spinning my wheels, but...

00:35.080 --> 00:38.290
‘ちょっとポジティブ’がいいんじゃない？

00:35.080 --> 00:38.290
chotto POJITIBU ga iinjanai

00:35.080 --> 00:38.290
Why don't you act a little more positive?

00:38.420 --> 00:42.010
自分らしいキャラでいい

00:38.420 --> 00:42.010
jibunrashii KYARA de ii

00:38.420 --> 00:42.010
You should be yourself.

00:42.130 --> 00:47.850
でもね... ハチャメチャなシナリオは

00:42.130 --> 00:47.850
demo nee... HACHAMECHA na SHINARIO wa

00:42.130 --> 00:47.850
But you know, a messed up scenario

00:49.510 --> 00:55.020
愛すべき 未来に変わって いく

00:49.510 --> 00:55.020
aisubeki asu ni kawatte iku

00:49.510 --> 00:55.020
will turn into a lovable tomorrow.

00:55.020 --> 00:56.520
TRUST MY WAY

00:56.560 --> 01:01.980
THE WIND 頬をなでる

00:56.560 --> 01:01.980
THE WIND hoho wo naderu

00:56.560 --> 01:01.980
The wind, it caresses my cheek.

01:02.240 --> 01:05.660
風と-緒に心地好く

01:02.240 --> 01:05.660
kaze to issho ni kokochiyoku

01:02.240 --> 01:05.660
Together with this comfortable breeze,

01:05.660 --> 01:10.540
楽しめる速度でこれからも

01:05.660 --> 01:10.540
tanoshimeru sokudo de kore kara mo

01:05.660 --> 01:10.540
and at a rate I also enjoy,

01:10.660 --> 01:16.170
ずっと変わらない想い

01:10.660 --> 01:16.170
zutto kawaranai omoi

01:10.660 --> 01:16.170
these feelings won't ever change.

01:16.420 --> 01:20.750
終わらない夢を握りしめて

01:16.420 --> 01:20.750
owaranai yume wo nigirishimete

01:16.420 --> 01:20.750
I"m taking hold of that endless dream.

01:20.750 --> 01:24.380
TRUST ME MY WAY

01:40.430 --> 01:42.810
I'm sorry, Mitsuki, Anna-chan.

01:44.760 --> 01:46.980
I got a little something extra from the store clerk.

01:51.200 --> 01:53.330
Oh! I cooked it rather well, if I may say so myself!

01:53.490 --> 01:56.250
I guess you get perks like this every now and then.

01:58.870 --> 01:59.760
W-What?

02:03.750 --> 02:04.550
A-Anna-chan?

02:09.130 --> 02:10.430
That surprised me!

02:10.430 --> 02:12.290
I wonder what that sound was!

02:15.540 --> 02:17.210
H-Hey, Anna-chan...

02:17.330 --> 02:19.840
Izumi-san, you smell so yummy!

02:22.560 --> 02:25.390
R-Right now, that sound is more important!

02:28.280 --> 02:33.230
He is Izumi's❤❤❤!?

02:35.670 --> 02:36.650
W-What the...?

02:48.930 --> 02:51.830
Don't tell me the cause of this shaking is...

02:52.000 --> 02:52.640
him?

02:53.470 --> 02:55.550
Pochi, aren't you too fat?

02:57.310 --> 03:00.120
It must be because of the luxurious life you lead in this house.

03:00.420 --> 03:04.570
There are people who say you're cute and all, but that's only because you're an alligator.

03:04.930 --> 03:07.560
Just imagine if you were human.

03:09.340 --> 03:11.260
Being so fat isn't good for your health.

03:11.420 --> 03:12.720
Is he going to hibernate or something?

03:13.090 --> 03:15.700
Actually, the reason Pochi is fat must be...

03:15.930 --> 03:17.510
Well, let's put him on a diet!

03:17.650 --> 03:20.570
Round One: The Pochi Diet Contest!

03:21.870 --> 03:24.040
The Pochi Diet Contest!!

03:22.170 --> 03:23.350
Do your best, Pochi!

03:24.180 --> 03:26.560
I'm not involved this time!

03:26.980 --> 03:29.190
I can just relax and watch.

03:29.480 --> 03:30.610
So, what are you going to do?

03:34.360 --> 03:35.760
Aaand... Start!

03:38.790 --> 03:40.310
W-What are you doing?!

03:40.700 --> 03:44.100
Well, now that Fall is here, you've been wearing thicker clothes.

03:44.200 --> 03:47.470
You're showing less skin, so Pochi hasn't been chasing you around as much, Onee-chan.

03:47.770 --> 03:49.990
In other words, the reason he got fat is due to a lack of exercise!

03:50.240 --> 03:52.360
That's it Mitsuki-chan. You've got it all figured out!

03:52.470 --> 03:53.660
And so...

03:54.370 --> 03:56.280
If Onee-chan wears less clothing...

03:57.490 --> 03:58.780
IZUMI!

04:01.790 --> 04:02.820
Noo!

04:02.920 --> 04:03.450
Do your best, Izumi!

04:03.480 --> 04:04.100
Just like that!

04:04.850 --> 04:06.450
No, stop it, Pochi!

04:07.110 --> 04:08.290
N-No, Pochi!

04:08.640 --> 04:10.400
Let go of Izumi-san this instant!

04:10.810 --> 04:11.880
If you don't...

04:12.030 --> 04:15.910
I'll destroy all your prized images gathered from the Internet along with your computer!

04:17.060 --> 04:17.930
What the hell?

04:18.010 --> 04:19.580
This doesn't qualify as exercise!

04:19.710 --> 04:20.890
What a useless bitch.

04:21.070 --> 04:22.920
I'd die before it ever did!

04:23.230 --> 04:25.420
In that case, we'll have to monitor his food.

04:25.770 --> 04:28.940
A diet is originally a restriction of food!

04:26.990 --> 04:28.360
You two, take those off as well!

04:29.120 --> 04:32.180
But, Master, Pochi is a gourmet!

04:32.340 --> 04:34.460
That's all right. I know his weakness!

04:34.630 --> 04:35.990
He's weak when it comes to women!

04:36.320 --> 04:38.600
In other words, if a cute girl really puts on the charm,

04:38.930 --> 04:41.240
he'll eat anything, even if it's pig's food or Izumi's cooking!

04:42.580 --> 04:44.020
WHO'S GOING TO DO THAT?!

04:45.340 --> 04:46.980
I'll give up on the naked apron.

04:47.130 --> 04:49.430
So please, Anna-chan... make something!

04:51.360 --> 04:51.880
All right!

04:52.220 --> 04:54.020
I'll do my very best to make something!

04:54.320 --> 04:55.010
I'm finished!

04:55.160 --> 04:55.880
It's a stew!

04:56.320 --> 04:58.270
The ingredients are ground meat, pickled daikon, salted fish entrails,

04:56.320 --> 05:01.340
A 'daikon' (大根) is a type of white radish, while a 'daifuku' (大福餅) is a rice cake filled with sweet bean paste.

04:58.300 --> 05:00.640
jam, dried sardines, daifuku, and a bunch of other stuff!

05:01.490 --> 05:02.300
Pochi...

05:05.010 --> 05:05.900
This is even better than I expected!

05:06.150 --> 05:07.290
This will take Pochi down a couple of notches!

05:07.410 --> 05:08.800
He will give up once his stomach caves in!

05:09.480 --> 05:10.690
Eat up, all right?

05:10.920 --> 05:12.350
Well, doesn't that look delicious?

05:12.670 --> 05:15.980
Of course, you wouldn't dare waste something a girl has cooked for you, right?

05:16.430 --> 05:19.220
You're a feminist, aren't you?!

05:23.760 --> 05:25.270
Ah! A cockroach!

05:25.580 --> 05:26.080
P-Pesticide!

05:26.250 --> 05:26.830
Pesticide!

05:29.270 --> 05:30.630
What, it's a toy?

05:30.830 --> 05:32.050
What's it doing here?

05:32.330 --> 05:34.530
Hey, Yoshitaka-kun, what's wrong?

05:38.270 --> 05:39.260
Absolute silence!<b>
Meals only given mouth-to-mouth</b>

05:39.270 --> 05:40.220
Must be accompanied to baths (buy maids only)

05:40.230 --> 05:40.720
Naked apron recommended

05:40.890 --> 05:41.970
REJECTED

05:47.780 --> 05:48.850
Damn it...

05:49.550 --> 05:51.240
That damn Pochi...

05:54.020 --> 05:55.280
DAMN IT!

05:57.430 --> 05:59.350
I can't forgive a bastard like you, Pochi!

06:02.250 --> 06:03.540
WHAT THE HELL IS POCHI?!

06:03.720 --> 06:04.900
IS HE REALLY AN ALLIGATOR?!

06:05.100 --> 06:06.950
Calm down, Master.

06:07.080 --> 06:08.480
But there's something strange about him!

06:08.620 --> 06:10.540
He walks on two legs, he acts strangely human...

06:10.680 --> 06:12.320
There's no <i>way</i> he's a normal alligator!

06:12.630 --> 06:14.300
Maybe there's a person inside?

06:14.390 --> 06:15.450
A zipper on his back or something?!

06:15.540 --> 06:16.810
There's no way that's true!

06:17.110 --> 06:19.720
We've looked after him since he was born.

06:19.840 --> 06:20.620
Pochi is norm-

06:22.180 --> 06:23.390
At any rate, he's an alligator!

06:23.430 --> 06:24.220
No doubt about it!

06:24.470 --> 06:26.790
Weren't you just about to say "normal"?

06:30.130 --> 06:31.770
Damn that Pochi!

06:32.170 --> 06:34.330
I swear I'll show them all someday!

06:34.890 --> 06:37.950
Chise, Kasumi, Ramu, Misuzu, Corona, Iyo!

06:37.950 --> 06:39.170
Here's your food!

06:47.850 --> 06:48.500
Pochi!

06:48.580 --> 06:49.890
I won't forgive you any more!

06:50.330 --> 06:52.580
I've considered your unhappy circumstances and treated you kindly until now,

06:52.780 --> 06:55.270
but you need to get out of this house TODAY!

06:56.690 --> 06:57.540
I'm up to it!

06:57.750 --> 07:00.970
It'd be much more fitting for <i>you</i> to get out and search for scraps of food!

07:01.080 --> 07:05.000
You deviant lolicon, perverted, sexual-harassing, shut-in otaku bastard!

07:05.310 --> 07:06.560
What was that?!

07:08.990 --> 07:09.640
Mitsuki!

07:09.690 --> 07:12.530
Stop adding fuel to the fire!

07:12.640 --> 07:14.010
Don't worry, Onee-chan!

07:14.290 --> 07:18.830
No matter what I say, Master can't kick Pochi out!

07:19.480 --> 07:21.320
How can you say something like that?

07:21.700 --> 07:27.050
That's because Master's current lifestyle is due to Pochi's presence here.

07:27.520 --> 07:31.950
Onee-chan, you and I need a place to keep Pochi, so that's why we're here.

07:32.370 --> 07:35.340
And Anna-san stays here because you're here, Onee-chan.

07:35.420 --> 07:36.930
Th-That's ridiculous!

07:37.510 --> 07:40.220
Are you saying I'm dependent on Pochi?

07:41.000 --> 07:42.000
Master...

07:42.360 --> 07:45.450
Master, do you like your current lifestyle?

07:54.730 --> 07:56.470
Well, I guess I'm satisfied.

07:56.940 --> 07:59.060
Everyone has to give and take a little bit, huh?

07:59.170 --> 08:02.050
So you can get along with Pochi!

08:02.360 --> 08:04.110
That's right, Yoshitaka-kun.

08:05.160 --> 08:06.950
Now shake hands and make up!

08:13.470 --> 08:14.210
Wait a second!

08:15.020 --> 08:16.960
Haven't you forgotten something vital here?

08:17.290 --> 08:18.170
That is to say, Izumi!

08:18.420 --> 08:18.960
Huh?

08:19.410 --> 08:22.050
You have an enormous debt to repay me!

08:22.620 --> 08:27.380
As long as that exists, <i>you</i> for one, will remain here whether you like it or not!

08:28.180 --> 08:29.100
That's right!

08:29.260 --> 08:32.140
It doesn't look like Onee-chan can repay the debt anytime soon,

08:32.140 --> 08:33.280
so there's nothing to worry about!

08:33.370 --> 08:34.430
Worry about it!

08:34.630 --> 08:39.610
So in the end, everyone is here simply for their own interests.

08:40.070 --> 08:44.020
Certainly not because they have any sort of attachment to Yoshitaka-kun, right?

08:44.170 --> 08:46.750
U-Um... that's how it is!

08:47.060 --> 08:49.060
Doesn't that make you a little sad?

08:49.620 --> 08:51.600
That's how it is for me!

08:52.550 --> 08:55.190
My body and soul, I devote them to Izumi-san!

08:55.520 --> 08:57.150
Like I said, you don't need to do that!

08:57.270 --> 08:58.920
Oh, Izumi-san...

08:57.670 --> 08:59.300
H-Hey, Anna-chan, calm down!

09:04.360 --> 09:09.500
If it weren't for Pochi and my debt, I could leave anytime.

09:11.970 --> 09:12.680
That's right.

09:12.850 --> 09:14.880
Somewhere along the way I got accustomed to this place, but...

09:17.680 --> 09:20.300
It really is frightening, getting used to this.

09:34.540 --> 09:36.090
That damn Pochi...

09:36.300 --> 09:40.850
You would think you'd find female alligator pictures or something on a real alligator's homepage, but...

09:41.370 --> 09:45.450
So this is why the bill for overseas calls was so high last month, huh?

09:46.800 --> 09:54.060
Anna's magazine is based on a real magazine called 'Yuri Shimai' (百合姉妹), or Lily Sisters, which showcases yuri (lesbian)-themed manga.

09:49.290 --> 09:50.910
What is it, Yoshitaka-kun?

09:51.090 --> 09:52.480
The door was left open, so I...

09:53.430 --> 09:54.060
A-A-Anna-chan!

09:54.700 --> 09:57.550
Th-These are some treasured pictures that Pochi gathered from the Internet!

09:58.030 --> 10:00.570
Uh, here, it's the one you found the other day!

10:00.760 --> 10:01.950
I did?

10:02.050 --> 10:03.570
But that Pochi...

10:03.690 --> 10:05.730
For an alligator, he has surprisingly good taste!

10:06.510 --> 10:08.600
So I'll be taking all of these!

10:12.160 --> 10:14.400
Th-This is Izumi, isn't it?

10:14.860 --> 10:18.680
It must be. This mole on her upper arm... there's no mistaking it.

10:19.640 --> 10:22.080
Wa- THIS IS AT MY HOUSE!

10:22.370 --> 10:24.160
I'm so sorry, Yoshitaka-kun.

10:24.870 --> 10:26.350
It was me.

10:27.840 --> 10:29.360
Now that you've seen this...

10:29.800 --> 10:31.720
Yoshitaka-kun...

10:32.190 --> 10:33.590
Y-You have to die!

10:33.930 --> 10:34.940
S-Stop it, Anna-chan!

10:35.150 --> 10:37.330
Let's just consider this a mistake!

10:37.580 --> 10:38.560
Then this is your warning!

10:38.740 --> 10:42.080
Please pray for Izumi-san's and my happiness in the next world!

10:42.470 --> 10:44.050
Ah, that's not what I call a warning!

10:46.850 --> 10:47.850
I'm home!

10:50.530 --> 10:52.190
I'm home, huh?

10:52.590 --> 10:54.750
What are you two doing?!

10:55.020 --> 10:56.280
Hurry up and figure it out, moron!

10:56.430 --> 10:57.350
Help me!

10:57.460 --> 10:59.170
This is for our happiness together too!

10:59.280 --> 10:59.930
It's all right!

10:59.960 --> 11:01.180
It won't hurt for very long!

11:02.750 --> 11:05.340
Welcome! You are the

11:02.750 --> 11:05.340
th visitor

11:02.750 --> 11:05.340
It's Kurauchi Anna's Page!

11:02.750 --> 11:05.340
Anna's Diary

11:02.750 --> 11:05.340
Main Bulletin Board

11:03.540 --> 11:05.270
I'm sorry, Izumi-san

11:05.790 --> 11:08.440
I want to be with you no matter what I have to do.

11:08.880 --> 11:14.650
If I could use my homepage to make it seem like we had a relationship... Make people believe that it were true...

11:15.190 --> 11:18.170
Then I thought I could somehow make it happen for real.

11:18.830 --> 11:22.810
So... what in the world are these pictures of?

11:23.140 --> 11:24.770
What's with this one?

11:24.930 --> 11:27.230
That's the space between Izumi-san's fingers.

11:27.330 --> 11:27.840
HUH?

11:28.100 --> 11:29.000
Then what's this?

11:29.190 --> 11:30.850
The start of Izumi-san's hair.

11:32.260 --> 11:34.240
Where did you... Wh-When did you get these?!

11:34.520 --> 11:36.980
Izumi-san's earlobes are my favorites!

11:37.210 --> 11:40.810
No, but these aren't the ones that were on Pochi's computer.

11:41.100 --> 11:42.350
What do you mean by that?

11:42.520 --> 11:45.660
Are you saying there's someone besides Anna-chan doing these things?

11:46.500 --> 11:47.240
Izumi...

11:49.240 --> 11:50.820
Here, look closely.

11:51.810 --> 11:52.300
Here.

11:52.570 --> 11:53.270
And there!

11:53.490 --> 11:54.190
And over there!

11:55.280 --> 11:57.870
You certainly are careless for not noticing by now.

11:59.200 --> 12:00.980
IT'S OBVIOUSLY ME!

12:01.250 --> 12:02.560
So that's the kind of giant pervert you really are!

12:02.640 --> 12:04.150
What were you thinking?!

12:04.170 --> 12:07.030
I'm too embarrassed to walk outside with these things spread all over the world!

12:07.210 --> 12:09.930
Wa-Wait... I'm not the one who put them on the Internet!

12:10.390 --> 12:13.250
Who else besides you would do these terrible things?!

12:13.550 --> 12:15.310
Don't forget, Izumi!

12:15.610 --> 12:18.100
You're <i>my</i> maid and indebted to <i>me</i>!

12:18.610 --> 12:23.050
Since I've nurtured your growth in this house, you have no right to object to anything I do to you!

12:34.820 --> 12:36.290
Well, do you get it?

12:37.160 --> 12:37.930
What is it?

12:38.970 --> 12:39.440
Hey!

12:40.510 --> 12:41.220
Izumi?

12:42.880 --> 12:45.510
Why can't you do anything besides this?

12:50.240 --> 12:51.110
I've had enough!

12:51.360 --> 12:53.620
I'm leaving this place right away!

12:55.530 --> 12:57.450
A Few Minutes Earlier

13:04.220 --> 13:05.030
Hello!

13:09.120 --> 13:10.590
Can I help you with something?

13:10.980 --> 13:12.510
Ah, no, that is, um...

13:13.140 --> 13:13.960
Pochi!

13:14.590 --> 13:15.470
Pochi!

13:15.550 --> 13:16.430
Pochi!

13:16.430 --> 13:17.300
Pochi!

13:17.430 --> 13:18.050
Pochi!

13:27.660 --> 13:29.110
What are you doing?

13:29.310 --> 13:31.760
I-I'm sorry. Just spare my life!

13:33.770 --> 13:35.740
It looks like you put Pochi into a bad mood...

13:39.020 --> 13:39.690
This is...

13:41.350 --> 13:42.970
Ah, well, that is, you know...

13:44.340 --> 13:45.040
Izumi-san!

13:45.150 --> 13:45.850
Izumi!

13:46.320 --> 13:47.730
Are you trying to bail on your debt?!

13:56.330 --> 13:56.930
Po-Pochi?

14:03.110 --> 14:03.860
Onee-chan!

14:04.080 --> 14:04.550
Izumi!

14:04.660 --> 14:05.570
Izumi-san!

14:08.980 --> 14:10.840
Onee-chan, you should go inside...

14:10.930 --> 14:11.510
I said no!

14:11.750 --> 14:13.380
That's your punishment for attempting to bail on your debt.

14:13.510 --> 14:14.720
That has nothing to do with it!

14:15.770 --> 14:17.770
Please excuse me for butting in.

14:18.060 --> 14:21.630
Actually, allow me to introduce myself. Here, my card.

14:22.100 --> 14:25.210
"Office Just One - Exclusivity Scout"?

14:26.570 --> 14:29.430
Did you see my Net-Idol Gateway?!

14:29.530 --> 14:31.110
Yes, yes, that's right.

14:31.500 --> 14:36.780
And so, if it is acceptable, I would like the exclusive rights to Izumi-san for our production group.

14:36.860 --> 14:37.740
That's incredible!

14:37.890 --> 14:39.170
You did it, Onee-chan!

14:39.490 --> 14:41.440
What's this "gateway"?

14:42.290 --> 14:44.380
There's no way I can consent to something so suspicious!

14:44.490 --> 14:46.280
I'm just a middle-school student.

14:46.420 --> 14:48.480
Everyone says that at first.

14:48.600 --> 14:52.920
If you wish to see how you like it, the signing bonus should be satisfactory.

14:53.020 --> 14:56.490
Um, so you mean that I can earn money this way?

14:56.600 --> 14:58.310
Of course you can!

14:59.660 --> 15:00.520
Here's my chance!

15:00.800 --> 15:04.040
Here's a chance to say farewell to this house without any apologies!

15:04.450 --> 15:07.150
God must have been watching over me after all!

15:13.660 --> 15:14.220
I'll do it!

15:14.520 --> 15:15.370
Please let me do it!

15:15.550 --> 15:16.770
I'll do my best!

15:17.020 --> 15:18.850
Well, that was quick!

15:19.030 --> 15:20.670
The president will be pleased as well.

15:21.110 --> 15:21.950
Hold it right there!

15:22.930 --> 15:25.750
Who cares about the president of some niche market production company?

15:26.170 --> 15:28.770
Don't just come in here and talk like that to someone's maid!

15:29.010 --> 15:31.340
I've gone through a lot to smooth her rough edges!

15:31.520 --> 15:34.790
She's my maid who owes me a large sum of money!

15:34.960 --> 15:35.860
Because I'm a maid.

15:36.440 --> 15:37.280
That's right.

15:37.650 --> 15:42.590
If I weren't your maid, you wouldn't have any business with me!

15:43.140 --> 15:44.290
Yeah, that's right. You said it!

15:44.580 --> 15:48.120
I can tell by your choice of words that you yearn to be my true love!

15:48.120 --> 15:49.160
All right!

15:49.160 --> 15:49.580
Idiot!

15:50.120 --> 15:51.410
Even if I have to die a hundred times over, I refuse!

15:51.730 --> 15:52.250
All right!

15:52.460 --> 15:54.370
I have a good idea!

15:54.750 --> 15:55.530
Huh?

15:55.530 --> 15:58.950
Let's have Master and Pochi run a race now!

15:59.270 --> 16:04.840
They'll run in opposite directions, and if Master can succeed on the treadmill, he wins!

16:05.050 --> 16:06.700
What's with this set?

16:06.830 --> 16:11.140
I thought we might do something like this, so I had everyone in the Bodyguard Squad build it for me!

16:11.960 --> 16:13.840
For the sake of out Mitsuki-chan!

16:14.000 --> 16:16.510
Why do Pochi and I have to have a contest?

16:16.610 --> 16:20.300
Because Pochi looks like he agrees with Onee-chan becoming an idol!

16:22.200 --> 16:22.890
Huh?

16:27.800 --> 16:30.300
Pochi... you're doing it for me?

16:32.030 --> 16:33.430
Who would go along with that kind of contest?!

16:33.510 --> 16:36.500
I've also made sure to prepare a nice prize for you, Master!

16:36.830 --> 16:38.660
Onee-chan's underwear collection!

16:38.920 --> 16:41.030
I'll put it at your goal, Master.

16:41.180 --> 16:42.430
Why are you using <i>mine</i>?!

16:42.460 --> 16:44.720
If you're going to put something out, use your ow-No, that's disgusting!

16:44.750 --> 16:45.690
Don't put anything out at all!

16:45.890 --> 16:47.610
Of course you'll do it, right?

16:47.910 --> 16:49.680
If that's how it is, then naturally!

16:50.170 --> 16:51.620
And what's more, if I win...

16:52.060 --> 16:53.430
You'll be my maid for the rest of your life!

17:04.210 --> 17:04.940
Ready, and...

17:05.080 --> 17:05.650
Wait!

17:07.110 --> 17:09.560
That match... let me do it!

17:11.480 --> 17:12.660
Thank you, Pochi.

17:13.120 --> 17:14.070
You were doing it for me.

17:14.350 --> 17:17.210
But I have to do this contest.

17:17.780 --> 17:20.600
I have to earn this victory myself.

17:23.200 --> 17:24.170
Stop it, Pochi!

17:24.330 --> 17:25.020
That's great, Izumi!

17:25.290 --> 17:27.220
I'm sorry, Izumi-san, but I'll be helping myself!

17:27.570 --> 17:30.030
Onee-chan, don't hurt yourself. Are you all right?

17:30.300 --> 17:33.290
That's true. You have to take care of your body before your debut.

17:34.000 --> 17:36.250
Which is why we should hurry up and START!

17:43.030 --> 17:45.080
Will this make things right?

17:45.480 --> 17:47.840
I'm sure Master will understand.

17:48.090 --> 17:49.420
Or rather, we'll make him understand.

17:49.580 --> 17:54.010
And I have a lot of good ideas on how to make Onee-chan's big break!

17:55.060 --> 17:56.490
Oh, you want to talk about that already?

17:56.790 --> 17:57.970
First we'll...

17:58.150 --> 17:59.300
There's no <i>way</i> I'll lose!

17:59.570 --> 18:01.050
And then the underwear will be mine!

18:01.190 --> 18:03.750
I'm going to sign that contract and get the hell out of here!

18:04.140 --> 18:04.760
That's right.

18:04.840 --> 18:06.100
That Izumi is so persistent!

18:06.380 --> 18:08.810
I'm going to get out of here as soon as I can!

18:09.060 --> 18:10.390
I need to remember my determination!

18:11.900 --> 18:13.020
Ah, I can see the goal!

18:13.300 --> 18:16.070
Shit! Everything in front of me is turning white!

18:16.560 --> 18:17.790
As if I'd lose!

18:22.480 --> 18:23.640
Th-This is...

18:25.330 --> 18:26.360
That's right!

18:26.780 --> 18:31.010
If Izumi becomes an idol, she can legitimately do even more of this and that and...

18:34.210 --> 18:35.300
I don't mind losing after all.

18:35.770 --> 18:36.180
Huh?

18:40.860 --> 18:43.460
All right! So it's Onee-chan's victory!

18:43.660 --> 18:44.540
Congratulations!

18:45.150 --> 18:47.060
What... What in the world happened?

18:47.360 --> 18:48.610
Did I win?

18:48.950 --> 18:49.400
All right!

18:49.520 --> 18:51.120
I'm going to help myself to your underwear set while I have a chance!

18:52.320 --> 18:53.760
Izumi-san's scent...

18:54.190 --> 18:56.090
I'm going to change into them right away!

18:56.290 --> 18:58.450
Anna-chan, I'll take the ones you're taking off now, so give them to me!

18:58.680 --> 18:59.670
As if!

18:59.920 --> 19:02.820
Honestly, I can't let my guard down around your two at all!

19:05.180 --> 19:08.720
Well then, now that I have Yoshitaka-sama's consent,

19:09.110 --> 19:11.100
please sign this contract.

19:12.120 --> 19:14.820
I bet it's just a sinkhole that will increase your debt even more.

19:14.890 --> 19:15.550
Shut up!

19:17.430 --> 19:20.050
So... what does an idol do?

19:20.160 --> 19:22.310
"What" you ask? They do this kind of stuff!

19:22.540 --> 19:24.530
Don't go out of your way to show those!

19:24.660 --> 19:27.990
Ah, you have nothing to worry about. We don't do nude pictures of anyone.

19:28.170 --> 19:29.120
Of course not!

19:29.210 --> 19:30.900
How old do you think I am?!

19:31.000 --> 19:32.150
That's a crime!

19:32.350 --> 19:35.180
With this, it won't be a big change from the way things are now.

19:35.310 --> 19:36.270
It will, it will!

19:36.400 --> 19:38.050
You'll get a lot of fans!

19:38.270 --> 19:39.680
I don't need the embarrassment!

19:39.810 --> 19:44.750
And besides, if you save your money, maybe Pochi will be able to come home with us!

19:45.440 --> 19:46.660
I-I see.

19:47.150 --> 19:47.890
I guess you're right.

19:48.370 --> 19:51.260
If I have money, I can settle anything and everything.

19:51.600 --> 19:52.200
H-Hey!

19:52.490 --> 19:54.970
Don't tell me you're also planing to leave, Mitsuki-chan!

19:55.390 --> 19:56.950
There's nothing to worry about.

19:56.950 --> 20:00.070
We're talking about what would happen if Onee-chan repays her debt.

20:00.310 --> 20:05.970
As long as she has even 100 yen of debt left, Master would easily turn it into 10,000,000 yen!

20:06.160 --> 20:07.340
Really?

20:07.420 --> 20:08.150
That's true, isn't it!

20:08.360 --> 20:09.240
I can always do that!

20:10.040 --> 20:12.780
At least say those kinds of things so I can't hear them!

20:13.080 --> 20:14.560
Um, I'm sorry.

20:14.950 --> 20:17.410
Can I think about it a little more?

20:17.820 --> 20:18.930
Really?

20:18.980 --> 20:23.080
Then I look forward to hearing a favorable response the next time I am here.

20:27.610 --> 20:33.110
Even so, in the end we still don't know how those pictures of Izumi got distributed.

20:33.550 --> 20:35.140
That's right! I forgot!

20:35.420 --> 20:37.310
It was you! You trash, you trash!

20:37.420 --> 20:38.310
Like I said, it wasn't me!

20:38.390 --> 20:39.550
Are you still saying that?!

20:39.750 --> 20:41.120
It was me.

20:41.200 --> 20:41.820
Huh?!

20:42.070 --> 20:46.040
I found out that Master had pictures of Onee-chan in his database...

20:47.030 --> 20:50.160
But I deleted all the ones of me and Anna-san!

20:51.030 --> 20:51.630
See?

20:51.800 --> 20:53.290
It wasn't me, Izumi!

20:53.860 --> 20:54.600
I-WHAT?!

20:55.110 --> 20:56.010
I'm sorry.

20:56.390 --> 21:00.010
I thought if I could help repay Onee-chan's debt, even just a little...

21:00.550 --> 21:01.430
Mitsuki...

21:01.960 --> 21:06.210
So I used the money I earned initially to make Onee-chan merchandise and sell them over the Internet.

21:06.970 --> 21:07.680
Mitsuki...

21:07.940 --> 21:09.230
Then my name is clear!

21:09.690 --> 21:10.900
Hurry up and say it!

21:12.040 --> 21:12.700
Shut UP!

21:12.990 --> 21:16.100
This all happened in the first place because of your disgusting hobby!

21:17.850 --> 21:19.360
I'm done for the day.

21:19.840 --> 21:21.540
My muscles ache, and my body is...

21:21.670 --> 21:22.850
Ow, ow, ow, ow.

21:24.920 --> 21:27.690
Today was busier than usual.

21:28.110 --> 21:32.040
Onee-chan's going out of her way to give it her all, so I have to try my hardest too!

21:33.690 --> 21:34.870
Look at this, Izumi!

21:35.050 --> 21:40.180
No matter how good you think your decision was today, I'll make you repent for it so much that you'll want to die!

21:43.610 --> 21:46.250
I got some new pictures today, too.

21:46.830 --> 21:48.910
I guess I should hurry and upload them to the gallery!

21:53.740 --> 21:55.880
"The crook of Izumi-san's knee..."

22:00.260 --> 22:01.780
Go to sleep already, Mitsuki.

22:01.660 --> 22:13.670
Izumi's debt from today

22:02.340 --> 22:02.970
Coming!

22:05.670 --> 22:13.670
Mitsuki's earnings so far

22:09.680 --> 22:13.670
How much Izumi has left before she pays off her debt

