見た目の甘さほどは

22:27.970 --> 22:31.400
mitame no amasa hodo ha

22:27.970 --> 22:31.400
They only appear sweet for a moment

22:31.410 --> 22:35.150
儚いとか 弱くもないから

22:31.410 --> 22:35.150
hakanai to ka yowaku mo nai kara

22:31.410 --> 22:35.150
and they're not weak either.

22:35.180 --> 22:40.120
女の子は結構頑丈よ

22:35.180 --> 22:40.120
onnanoko ha kekkou ganjou yo

22:35.180 --> 22:40.120
Girls are pretty stable.

22:42.200 --> 22:45.410
意地っ張り空回りを

22:42.200 --> 22:45.410
ijippari karamawari wo

22:42.200 --> 22:45.410
Because they're stubborn,

22:45.490 --> 22:49.270
楽しめちゃう余裕も大事ネ!

22:45.490 --> 22:49.270
tanoshimechau yoyuu mo daiji ne!

22:45.490 --> 22:49.270
they can enjoy getting nothing done; free time is precious, too.

22:49.280 --> 22:54.000
笑顔にはたっぷりのスパイスが

22:49.280 --> 22:54.000
egao ni ha tappuri no SUPAISU ga

22:49.280 --> 22:54.000
Is there a good deal of spice in that smile?

22:54.700 --> 22:56.330
どうかナ?

22:54.700 --> 22:56.330
dou ka na?

22:54.700 --> 22:56.330
I wonder...

22:56.610 --> 23:02.730
常識など壊す刺激的なヒミツ

22:56.610 --> 23:02.730
joushiki nado kowasu shigekitekina himitsu

22:56.610 --> 23:02.730
The stimulating secret that smashes common sense,

23:02.860 --> 23:10.350
スカートでそっと巧く隠してる

23:02.860 --> 23:10.350
SUKATTO de sotto umaku kakushiteru

23:02.860 --> 23:10.350
is well-concealed within their skirts.

23:10.450 --> 23:17.230
愛情のカタマリでこの気持ち出来てる

23:10.450 --> 23:17.230
aijou no katamari de kono kimochi dekiteru

23:10.450 --> 23:17.230
I have a feeling this can be a mass of love.

23:17.490 --> 23:24.210
キュんとなるシュンカンを夢みていたいから

23:17.490 --> 23:24.210
KYUN to naru shunkan wo yume miteitai kara

23:17.490 --> 23:24.210
Because I want to have dreams of this moment, that will not matter.

23:24.530 --> 23:31.540
愛情のカタマリでオトメは進化する

23:24.530 --> 23:31.540
aijou no katamari de otome ha shinka suru

23:24.530 --> 23:31.540
The maidens grow in a mass of love,

23:31.600 --> 23:38.650
トキメキもカガヤキも抱きしめているから

23:31.600 --> 23:38.650
TOKIMEKI mo kagayaki mo dakishimeteiru kara

23:31.600 --> 23:38.650
because they are embracing their glowing excitement.

23:44.680 --> 23:45.890
That's right, Onee-chan!

23:46.100 --> 23:50.690
If we can earn a lot of money, we'll be able to live with Karin too!

23:50.780 --> 23:52.120
That's right! Karin too!

23:52.280 --> 23:56.480
Well, that's nice and all, but am I going to be the only one to go through terrible things, so we can do that?

23:56.570 --> 23:57.320
Hey, hey!

23:57.320 --> 23:57.900
Who are you talking about?

23:57.940 --> 23:58.620
Don't tell me, you two have a-

23:58.740 --> 23:59.690
Ugh, Yoshitaka!

23:59.910 --> 24:01.260
I'm going to chew you out right now!

24:01.410 --> 24:03.930
It's enough that you have Mitsuki and me!

24:04.150 --> 24:08.530
When I fight for my little sisters, don't think of me as a normal maid!

24:08.650 --> 24:13.630
An Unbelievably
Short Strike Zone

24:08.980 --> 24:10.000
I see... I get it!

24:10.000 --> 24:10.580
So that's how it is?

24:11.310 --> 24:12.120
I'm excited!

24:12.260 --> 24:13.040
DON'T BE!
